// Possible Impacket SecretDump Remote Activity - Zeek | T1003.002, T1003.003, T1003.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/zeek/zeek_smb_converted_win_impacket_secretdump.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where path like "*\\*" and path like "*ADMIN$*" and name like "*SYSTEM32\\*" and ends_with(name, ".tmp")
